 886+ 6BB3              IsCellOnRamp:
 887+ 6BB3 C5               push bc
 888+ 6BB4 E5               push hl
 889+ 6BB5
 890+ 6BB5 3A F7 7D         ld   a, (ramp_len)
 891+ 6BB8 B7               or   a
 892+ 6BB9 28 6B            jr   z, .no
